      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seems that an old issue with this function has now got worse.\nIt used to be if you are the only person in a world and you used something that moved your character e.g sitting in a chair or using respawn, then the object rotation would break.\nNow it is broken from the moment you load in to the world.\nIt will start working again the moment someone else joins you in the world though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
