      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This happens if you are the only person in a world.\nSince the last patch this now happens from the time you enter the world, but previously this same thing would occur if you sat in a chair or respawned within the world.\nThe function will start working again if someone else joins the world you are in though.",
