      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Try having someone else join you in your world. This bug only occurs for me if I'm the only person in the world.\nIt is a bug that has been in since the function was added but before the last patch it only occured if you sat in a chair or respawned or did something else that forced your avatar to move, now it happens from the moment you enter the world.",
